Package: psios-core
Architecture: linux-any
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}, adduser, systemd, iproute2
Description: local PsiOS system authority and command-line client
 Provides the single-node system API, task broker, application and volume
 operations, and persistent agent sessions on an existing Linux host.
 The administrator explicitly initializes local authority state before
 enabling the system service.
